<div class="page-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">RECOGNITION WITH A REAL RECORD</span><h1>Recognise genuine progress.</h1><p>Certificates are issued only after server-validated path requirements. Public verification reflects revocations.</p></div><a href="<?= e(route_url('/admin/content/paths')) ?>" class="btn btn-secondary btn-small">Configure path eligibility <?= icon('arrow-right',14) ?></a></div><section class="card table-card"><?php if($certificates): ?><div class="table-responsive"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Learner & path</th><th>Issued</th><th>Status</th><th>Verification</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($certificates as $c): ?><tr><td><strong><?= e($c['learner_name']) ?></strong><small><?= e($c['path_title']) ?> · Record #<?= (int)$c['id'] ?></small></td><td><?= niceDate($c['issued_at'],'M j, Y') ?></td><td><?= badge($c['revoked_at']?'revoked':'valid') ?></td><td><a class="text-link small" href="<?= e(route_url('/verify/' . ($c['identifier']))) ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verify <?= icon('arrow-up-right',14) ?></a></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><?php pagination($total); ?><?php else:emptyState('award','The next milestone is still ahead.','Certificates will appear after a learner completes a path and requests an eligibility check. Enrolment and page views are not enough.');endif; ?></section><div class="admin-settings-grid" style="margin-top:25px"><section class="card form-card"><h2 class="form-section-title">Revoke only with a clear reason.</h2><p class="form-section-description">Revocation is permanent in this version and is recorded in the audit log. The public verification page will show the reason.</p><form method="post" action="<?= e(route_url('/api/admin/certificates/0/revoke')) ?>" data-certificate-revoke><?= csrfField() ?><div class="field"><label for="certificate-id">Certificate record</label><select id="certificate-id" name="certificate_id" required><option value="">Choose a valid certificate</option><?php foreach($certificates as $c):if($c['revoked_at'])continue; ?><option value="<?= (int)$c['id'] ?>">#<?= (int)$c['id'] ?> · <?= e($c['learner_name'].' — '.$c['path_title']) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div><div class="field"><label for="revoke-reason">Public revocation reason</label><textarea id="revoke-reason" name="reason" minlength="10" maxlength="500" required placeholder="State the factual reason without disclosing private information…"></textarea></div><button class="btn btn-danger">Revoke certificate <?= icon('shield',15) ?></button></form></section><section class="card card-pad"><h2 style="font-size:18px;margin-bottom:16px">A consistent, verifiable milestone.</h2><ul class="objective-list"><li><?= icon('check-circle',15) ?><span>All required lessons, quizzes and assignments are checked server-side.</span></li><li><?= icon('check-circle',15) ?><span>Each learner has at most one certificate per path.</span></li><li><?= icon('check-circle',15) ?><span>Names and course titles are preserved as issuance snapshots.</span></li><li><?= icon('check-circle',15) ?><span>The fixed Learnow template supports browser print and PDF saving.</span></li></ul><p class="fine-print">Template styling is maintained in the codebase. This build does not include a drag-and-drop certificate designer or external accreditation.</p></section></div>
